license: MIT
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-10-13
keywords:
  - cross-view synthesis
  - aerial imagery
  - semantic layout
  - CVUSA
  - SPADE
  - DINOv2
abstract: >-
  PyTorch pipeline for CVUSA-style aerial-to-ground synthesis: frozen DINOv2
  PolarLayoutNet (0.514 mIoU) and SPADE with warped aerial conditioning.
  Publication metrics use clean-FID (Config D oracle 141.0, Config E end-to-end 182.1, n=8884).
