notes: >-
  CVUSA image data is not included; obtain under the dataset's own terms at
  https://mvrl.cse.wustl.edu/datasets/cvusa/ . Trained checkpoints are distributed
  via Zenodo (see GitHub release v1.0.0). Baseline CrossNet follows Zhai et al., CVPR 2017.
